==Battleground==
*1 [[Angelic Slug]] spawns.
*1 [[Angelic Slug]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Slug]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*3 [[Gabriel]]s (400%) spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Gabriel]]s (400%) spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gabriel]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Angelic Slug]]s spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**6 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Boraphim]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**3 [[Cala Maria]]s spawn, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use multiple meatshields (especially [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]]) to stall the enemies in this level, while [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] stalls the Boraphims. Powerful attackers (e.g. [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N106 (Rare Cat)|Mushroom Cat]], etc.) that can quickly kill the Boraphims before they reach your base.

If you can get a decent stack of meatshields on the field while doing this, you can rush the Cala Maria and finish this stage before more threats begin to overwhelm you.

